1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,142
This decision agent improved from eighty-four to one hundred.

2
00:00:04,184 --> 00:00:09,793
The evaluation and optimization cycle cost about fifteen cents in model calls.

3
00:00:10,742 --> 00:00:18,416
We start with a simple role prompt and three fictional cases: after-sales support, procurement acceptance and launch approval.

4
00:00:19,325 --> 00:00:24,364
The procurement case includes revised rules, an earlier report and a source ledger.

5
00:00:24,405 --> 00:00:27,791
The agent must check versions and recalculate.

6
00:00:28,742 --> 00:00:31,232
The baseline averages eighty-four.

7
00:00:31,274 --> 00:00:36,991
Procurement scores fifty-seven, losing points on version checks and calculation evidence.

8
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:41,931
The execution trace records documents read and tool calls.

9
00:00:41,973 --> 00:00:46,199
The optimizer uses these records to investigate the failures.

10
00:00:47,158 --> 00:00:53,615
This update adds three steps: read original records, check policy versions and recalculate the ledger.

11
00:00:53,657 --> 00:00:56,634
These instructions are saved to the agent.

12
00:00:57,575 --> 00:01:00,847
All three cases score one hundred on the retest.

13
00:01:00,888 --> 00:01:05,932
The model, reasoning level and public evaluation materials stay the same.

14
00:01:06,908 --> 00:01:16,337
Baseline evaluation, optimization, scoring and six test runs total an estimated point one four five five dollars: about fifteen cents.

15
00:01:17,242 --> 00:01:23,125
The cost center lists usage by agent, model and session, so you can check each cycle.

16
00:01:24,033 --> 00:01:29,372
In the published coding benchmark, both setups score seventy-one point two five percent.

17
00:01:29,414 --> 00:01:34,662
With their respective models, Penguin Harness costs about one fifty-eighth as much.

18
00:01:35,617 --> 00:01:39,934
Add business cases, run optimization and compare versions.

19
00:01:39,976 --> 00:01:43,229
Each cycle retains its results and costs.

20
00:01:44,158 --> 00:01:48,332
Our goal is the most comprehensive agent self-evolution platform.

21
